{{Quote|The ''good'' news is that they're in ''total'' chaos. The ''bad'' news is we've got an Imperial ''holdout'' on the far side of the moon and they're ''dug'' in, waiting for an opportunity to ''counterattack''.|[[General]] [[Han Solo]]|<ref name="Shattered Empire 1" />}}
An '''Imperial outpost''' was located on the [[Forest]] [[Moon]] of [[Endor]] during the [[Battle of Endor]]. After the [[Galactic Empire]] was defeated during the battle, Imperial holdouts remained in the outpost in the hopes of launching a counterattack against the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]]. The [[Special Forces Trackers Unit|Pathfinders]], an [[Rebel Alliance Special Forces]] team, [[Assault on an Imperial outpost|assaulted]] and took control of the base, gaining intelligence about the Empire's post-Endor plans.<ref name="Shattered Empire 1" />

